<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DePuy started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DePuy started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Monday it had started coverage of DePuy Inc with a rating of strong buy.</p>
<p>-- The orthopedics company's shares closed at 17-3/4 on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street desk, (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
